    "name": "Sky: Malefic",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>The sky is hostile.</strong> Today's sign carries a <strong>-2</strong> circumstance penalty on its domain — the checks that constellation touches.</p><p><em>The sky is terrain. It applies to every creature, not only to a Saint.</em></p><hr /><table><thead><tr><th>Sign</th><th>Automated on</th><th>Also, by hand</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Aries</strong></td><td>initiative</td><td>The first Strike you make in each encounter is also affected — apply it by hand.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Taurus</strong></td><td>fortitude, athletics</td><td>Athletics to resist forced movement is also affected.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Gemini</strong></td><td>deception, diplomacy</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cancer</strong></td><td>medicine</td><td>Recovery checks, and Fortitude saves against disease and poison, are also affected.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Leo</strong></td><td>intimidation, performance</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Virgo</strong></td><td>crafting</td><td>Recall Knowledge with any skill, and Perception to Search, are also affected.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Libra</strong></td><td>—</td><td>Libra's domain is the die itself, not a list of checks — see the effect's own clause.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Scorpio</strong></td><td>stealth, thievery</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sagittarius</strong></td><td>ranged-attack-roll, survival</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capricorn</strong></td><td>athletics</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aquarius</strong></td><td>arcana, nature, occultism, religion, society</td><td>Counteract checks are also affected.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pisces</strong></td><td>will</td><td>Perception against illusions and to disbelieve them is also affected.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one sign is up on any given day, so only that row applies.</p>"
        },
